# Reports service (services/reports, node dist/main.js). Copy to env/reports.env; never commit it.
# Validated at startup by services/reports/src/config/env.ts. compose.yml sets everything it needs from ../.env:
# NODE_ENV=production, the port (3100), the CORS origin (https://${APP_DOMAIN}), Supabase (anon key only) and Redis.
# Nothing is required here; the file exists so the service has its own place for future settings.
